     A* Continuation with + and -, and strings spanning lines.
     A* Member: ICFCONT   Compilable: yes
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS concepts, continuation rules
     A* Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
00010A          R CONTREC
     A* + continues, discarding leading blanks on the next line
00020A                                      SECURITY(2 'PASSWRD' +
     A                                               3 'USRID')
     A* - continues, preserving leading blanks on the next line
00030A                                      TEXT('A description that runs -
     A                                      across two source lines')
     A* + continues a literal, discarding leading blanks
00035A                                      TEXT('A description that +
     A                                      continues on the next line')
     A* a comment may also sit inside the literal itself
00037A                                      TEXT('first half of-
     A* a comment between the two halves
     A                                      the literal')
     A* a comment may interrupt a continued keyword
00040A                                      EVOKE(MYLIB/ -
     A* this comment sits between the two halves
     A                                      SOMEPGM)
